[38;5;114m❯[0m [1;38;5;75mProject-FlyGate[0m [38;5;244mgit:([38;5;211mmain[38;5;244m)[0m flygate --help
usage: flygate [-h] {login,chat,triage,grade,signals,kr-causality,critic,discover,watch} ...

FlyGate agent tools: every command prints JSON with evidence IDs.

positional arguments:
  {login,chat,triage,grade,signals,kr-causality,critic,discover,watch}
    login               open NVIDIA key setup and register securely
    chat                interactive FlyGate chat with ASCII banner
    triage              reflex triage of one ICSR
    grade               evidence grade and PV class candidate for a drug-event pair
    signals             top disproportionality rows for one drug (SQL extract)
    kr-causality        structure a Korean report and score the Korean causality algorithm v2.0
    critic              run claims through the 3-tier critic (+ safety guard)
    discover            FlyDiscovery evidence and critic verdicts for a target
    watch               heartbeat/cron job: detect quarter, recompute watchlist, write memory note

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
